<!-- 2026-08-23: one StoreItem per Factory-roster plane, ItemType=Prefab (this is what makes
     a grid, not a component, sellable at an NPC store - confirmed against a real working
     example, GVK-Derelicts Workshop ID 2653133286, Data/StoreItems/GVK-Store-StoreItems-
     AllVehicles.xml). ItemSubtypeId references the CLEAN 100%-built Player-tier blueprint,
     not the _66pct/_33pct display copies - selling an unfinished plane doesn't make sense.
     MinAmount/MaxAmount are both 1 (a factory has exactly one of its own plane for sale, not
     a restockable batch, unlike GVK's own 10-15 range for a generic economy). Prices are
     placeholder estimates scaled roughly by block count/complexity - adjust freely, nothing
     about the mechanism depends on the exact number. -->
